     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past tense for narrating",
     "texto": [
      "The past tense places finished actions in the past: **I går tok jeg bussen** («Yesterday I took the bus»). Many regular verbs add **-et** or **-te** (for example **ventet**), but the common ones **gikk**, **tok**, **så** and **fant** are irregular and must be learned in context.",
      "**Først**, **så**, **plutselig**, **etterpå** and **til slutt** order the story. If the time marker comes first, the conjugated verb takes second position: **I går mistet jeg nøkkelen** («Yesterday I lost the key»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
