     "titulo": "Erik's keys",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "I går gikk Erik hjem etter kurset. Ved bussholdeplassen oppdaget han at han hadde mistet nøklene. Først sjekket han lommene, så ringte han til kursstedet. Ingen hadde sett dem. Heldigvis fant en nabo nøklene ved inngangen og la dem i postkassen. Erik hentet dem etterpå. Til slutt rakk han middagen hos en venn.",
       "alumno": "Yesterday Erik went home after the course. At the bus stop he realised he had lost his keys. First he checked his pockets; then he called the centre where the course was held. Nobody had seen them. Luckily, a neighbour found the keys by the entrance and left them in the letterbox. Erik picked them up afterwards. In the end he arrived in time for dinner at a friend's house.",
       "literal": "",
